.nh
.TH "PB-DOMAIN-ADD" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-domain-add - Add a domain and show its DNS records


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb domain add <domain> [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Add a domain and show its DNS records

.PP
Add an apex or subdomain and print the DNS records to create: the _acme-challenge CNAME that proves control, and the wildcard record that sends names under it to Paperboat.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for add

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  pb domain add dev.example.com
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-domain(1)\fP
